HST Office: visible Vietnamese ribbon button for the ND 30 wizard in HST Writer.

- sw/uiconfig/swriter/ui/notebookbar.ui (the Tabbed UI file HST selects by default, see
  hst-defaults.patch): a "Văn bản hành chính" button on the Home tab, in the right-hand
  block next to "Find & Replace" (the block never collapses into the overflow menu).
  It dispatches org.hst.office.vi:Nd30Wizard from the bundled HST extension. The label is
  written in the .ui file and is Vietnamese in every UI language (HST command).
- vcl/source/window/builder.cxx: commands of extensions have no entry in the command
  descriptions, so ToolBox::InsertItem() leaves the item label empty; fall back to the
  label of the .ui file. Items of .uno: commands are unchanged (their label is not empty).
  The same builder code is used by every VCL backend (gtk3, Windows), so the button
  looks and behaves the same on Windows; no platform-specific code is involved.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-nd30-entry.py (button opens the wizard, HST menu entries).
